<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Shop Floor Control & Execution</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            A real-time manufacturing execution engine that digitizes the factory floor, providing 
            absolute transparency and data-driven stewardship of the production process.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Work Order Dispatch & Visualization</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate paper bottlenecks with digital work order dispatch. Production orders 
            generated in planning are transmitted instantly to specific work centers 
            and assembly lines. Operators utilize station-based terminals to view their 
            current work queue, prioritized by clinical or commercial urgency. Digital 
            job cards (Travelers) provide the technical instructions and safety 
            checklists needed for every task, ensuring that production standards 
            are maintained consistently across all shifts.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Consumption & Progress Capture</h2>
        <p>
            Experience radical transparency into your production consumption. As work 
            progresses, operators log material usage and scrap quantities directly 
            at the station. This real-time data capture updates inventory levels 
            instantly and provides the empirical basis for precise 'Work-in-Progress' 
            (WIP) valuations. Worker-time-at-station tracking identifies 
            individual and team productivity levels, highlighting instructional or 
            technical gaps that may be impacting throughput.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Machine Downtime & Shift Handover</h2>
        <p>
            Minimize idle time with immediate downtime logging. Operators record machine 
            failures or material stock-outs as they occurs, triggering instant 
            notifications to Maintenance and Procurement teams. Automated shift 
            handover reports consolidate production progress, quality incidents, 
            and technical notes from the outgoing shift, ensuring that the 
            incoming team enters the floor with a complete operational 
            profile.
        </p>
        <p>
            This high-standard execution layer is the critical foundation for Overall Equipment 
            Effectiveness (OEE) optimization and industrial process maturation.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

